Below is a list of project context:
Spring AI makes it easy to have the AI model invoke your services as <code>@Tool</code>-annotated methods or POJO <code>java.util.Function</code> objects.

Check the Spring AI <a href=":api/tools.html">Tool Calling</a> documentation.
